    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t stop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1753286046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will find no safety or comforts within Eclipsium. Let pale light guide you along your perilous journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the spiral<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1753286046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights fade and senses dull at the presence of the looming Heart, its steady beat the only constant in a world devouring itself. It\u2019s hunger lurking just beneath your skin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1753286046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it\u2019s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.</p>",
