tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1753286046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it\u2019s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.</p>",
